--[[
	UpgradeConfig
	Stat upgrades bought with Growth Energy. Each upgrade adds `PerLevel` to a
	named stat (see Formulas/Stats for how stats are consumed). Categories
	unlock gradually via RequiredTier so new players are not overwhelmed.
	Some upgrades also need zone resources every few levels, which keeps old
	regions worth revisiting.
]]

